CORE
main.c
--unwind 2 --rounds 3 --por --signed-overflow-check
^EXIT=10$
^SIGNAL=0$
^VERIFICATION FAILED$
--
^VERIFICATION SUCCESSFUL$
--
Control for `atomic_section_check_inside`: the second thread increments
`x` without taking the mutex, so an increment really can be lost. Must stay
FAILED before and after.
